{"seq":3,"slug":"fts5-search-and-retrieval","title":"SQLite FTS5 全文检索与召回","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/fts5-search-and-retrieval","wordCount":1102,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"sqlite-fts5-全文检索与召回\">SQLite FTS5 全文检索与召回</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 把 MEMORY.md 头部之外的 cold storage 条目、所有 session transcript、以及 curator 历史决策日志，统一索引进一个 SQLite 数据库的 FTS5 虚表。FTS5 是 SQLite 3.9+ 自带的全文检索模块，相比向量数据库的优势是<strong>零依赖、单文件、毫秒级查询、支持复杂布尔语法</strong>——对于 10^5 到 10^6 量级文档的个人记忆场景完全够用，且不需要 embedding 服务。Hermes 的 <code>memory_query</code> 工具暴露 FTS5 查询能力给所有 Tier 1 client 反向调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[MEMORY.md cold] --&gt; B[Indexer]&#10;  C[Session transcript] --&gt; B&#10;  D[Curator log] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; E[(SQLite FTS5)]&#10;  E --&gt; F[memory_query tool]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Tier 1 client]&#10;  F --&gt; H[Hermes runtime]\">flowchart LR\n  A[MEMORY.md cold] --&gt; B[Indexer]\n  C[Session transcript] --&gt; B\n  D[Curator log] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; E[(SQLite FTS5)]\n  E --&gt; F[memory_query tool]\n  F --&gt; G[Tier 1 client]\n  F --&gt; H[Hermes runtime]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>FTS5（Hermes 选择）</th>\n<th>向量数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>SQLite 内置</td>\n<td>需要 embedding 服务 + vector store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引大小</td>\n<td>原文 1.3-1.8x</td>\n<td>原文 + 768/1536 维 float32</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回</td>\n<td>词形匹配 + 布尔</td>\n<td>语义近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>&lt;10ms（10^5 doc）</td>\n<td>30-100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线运行</td>\n<td>完全离线</td>\n<td>多数需 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fts5-索引结构\">FTS5 索引结构</h2><p>Hermes 创建一个 contentless FTS5 虚表，正文不在虚表里重复存储，只存倒排索引——节省磁盘并允许同一份 MEMORY.md 文件作为唯一 source of truth：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE memory_idx USING fts5(&#10;  entry_id UNINDEXED,&#10;  title,&#10;  body,&#10;  tags,&#10;  tokenize = &#39;unicode61 remove_diacritics 2&#39;&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE memory_meta (&#10;  entry_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  importance REAL,&#10;  created_at INTEGER,&#10;  last_hit_at INTEGER,&#10;  source TEXT  -- memory_md / session / curator_log&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> VIRTUAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memory_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fts5(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id UNINDEXED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tags,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tokenize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unicode61 remove_diacritics 2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> memory_meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_hit_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- memory_md / session / curator_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>title</code> / <code>body</code> / <code>tags</code> 三列分别建索引，查询时可以分别 weight：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT entry_id, rank&#10;FROM memory_idx&#10;WHERE memory_idx MATCH &#39;{title body tags}: rpc kitex&#39;&#10;ORDER BY rank LIMIT 10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry_id, rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memory_idx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memory_idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{title body tags}: rpc kitex'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>{title body tags}: rpc kitex</code> 是 FTS5 列过滤语法，把搜索范围限定到这三列、词为 &quot;rpc&quot; 与 &quot;kitex&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"memory_query-api-语法\">memory_query API 语法</h2><p><code>memory_query</code> 工具的 input schema 把 FTS5 原生语法封装为更友好的字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: &quot;rpc OR kitex NOT deprecated&quot;,&#10;  &quot;top_k&quot;: 10,&#10;  &quot;filters&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;bytedance&quot;, &quot;rpc&quot;],&#10;    &quot;min_importance&quot;: 0.5,&#10;    &quot;since&quot;: &quot;2026-04-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source&quot;: [&quot;memory_md&quot;, &quot;curator_log&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;rank_mode&quot;: &quot;bm25_importance&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rpc OR kitex NOT deprecated\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"top_k\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"filters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bytedance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rpc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_importance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"since\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"memory_md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"curator_log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rank_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bm25_importance\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>query</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>FTS5 MATCH 表达式（AND/OR/NOT/NEAR/quoted phrase）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>top_k</td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>召回数量上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filters.tags</td>\n<td>string[]</td>\n<td>标签交集过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filters.min_importance</td>\n<td>float</td>\n<td>importance 下界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filters.since</td>\n<td>ISO date</td>\n<td>created_at 下界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rank_mode</td>\n<td>enum</td>\n<td><code>bm25</code> / <code>bm25_importance</code> / <code>recency</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>bm25_importance</code> 模式把 FTS5 内置的 BM25 分数与 memory_meta.importance 加权乘积，公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>bm25</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>importance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\text{bm25}(q, d) \\cdot (0.5 + 0.5 \\cdot \\text{importance}(d))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bm25</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">importance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>让&quot;importance 高但词形不完全匹配的条目&quot;和&quot;词形完美匹配但 importance 低的条目&quot;取得平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tokenizer-选型\">Tokenizer 选型</h2><p>FTS5 支持多种 tokenizer，Hermes 默认 <code>unicode61 remove_diacritics 2</code>，按 Unicode 类别切分、去除变音符号、保留汉字。但中文场景下 unicode61 把整句汉字按字符切，召回精度低——Hermes 提供两个可切换的 tokenizer：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tokenizer</th>\n<th>适用语言</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>unicode61</td>\n<td>拉丁 + 通用</td>\n<td>零依赖，零配置</td>\n<td>中文按单字切，无语义边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>porter</td>\n<td>英文为主</td>\n<td>词干合并（run/running/ran）</td>\n<td>不支持中文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jieba（第三方）</td>\n<td>中文</td>\n<td>真正分词，召回准确</td>\n<td>需 build flag 编译</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中文用户在 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/config.toml</code> 切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[memory.fts]&#10;tokenizer = &quot;jieba&quot;&#10;jieba_dict = &quot;~/.learnwy/hermes/jieba.dict&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[memory.fts]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokenizer = \"jieba\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>jieba_dict = \"~/.learnwy/hermes/jieba.dict\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>切换后必须 <code>hermes memory reindex</code> 重建索引——FTS5 的 tokenizer 是建表期决定的，运行时不可改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能特性\">性能特性</h2><p>Hermes 在自家 benchmark（10^5 条 memory entry，每条平均 300 字符）测得的延迟：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询类型</th>\n<th>P50</th>\n<th>P95</th>\n<th>P99</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单词查询</td>\n<td>1.8ms</td>\n<td>4.2ms</td>\n<td>7.5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔三词 AND</td>\n<td>2.4ms</td>\n<td>6.1ms</td>\n<td>11ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Phrase quoted</td>\n<td>3.1ms</td>\n<td>8.5ms</td>\n<td>15ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含 tag filter</td>\n<td>4.7ms</td>\n<td>12ms</td>\n<td>22ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含 importance rerank</td>\n<td>8.3ms</td>\n<td>21ms</td>\n<td>38ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>到 10^6 条仍维持 sub-100ms P99——这是 FTS5 倒排索引的 native 性能，不需要 lazy load 或 cache 优化。容量到 10^7 以上才需要考虑 sharded SQLite 或 DuckDB 替换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-tier-1-反向调用的接入\">与 Tier 1 反向调用的接入</h2><p>Tier 1 的 Claude Code 通过 MCP 反向调用 Hermes 的 <code>memory_query</code>。一个典型 round trip：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as Claude Code&#10;  participant M as MCP stdio&#10;  participant H as Hermes server&#10;  participant S as SQLite FTS5&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;M: tools/call memory_query&#10;  M-&gt;&gt;H: forward&#10;  H-&gt;&gt;S: SELECT FROM memory_idx&#10;  S--&gt;&gt;H: top_k entries&#10;  H--&gt;&gt;M: structured result&#10;  M--&gt;&gt;C: tool result\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Claude Code\n  participant M as MCP stdio\n  participant H as Hermes server\n  participant S as SQLite FTS5\n  C-&gt;&gt;M: tools/call memory_query\n  M-&gt;&gt;H: forward\n  H-&gt;&gt;S: SELECT FROM memory_idx\n  S--&gt;&gt;H: top_k entries\n  H--&gt;&gt;M: structured result\n  M--&gt;&gt;C: tool result</pre><p>返回结构带 <code>entry_id</code> / <code>title</code> / <code>body_excerpt</code> / <code>score</code> / <code>tags</code>，Claude Code 把 excerpt 拼进自己的 context 继续推理。详细接入配置见 <a href=\"../mcp-bidirectional/server-side-impl-hermes\"><code>../3_mcp-bidirectional/1_server-side-impl-hermes.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>直接拷 MEMORY.md 不重建索引</strong>：FTS5 不是自动同步的，curator 跑完才重建。手动改完 MEMORY.md 需要 <code>hermes memory reindex</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>中文召回为零</strong>：默认 unicode61 把 &quot;RPC调用&quot; 切成 &quot;R&quot; &quot;P&quot; &quot;C&quot; &quot;调&quot; &quot;用&quot;，搜 &quot;RPC&quot; 找不到含 &quot;RPC调用&quot; 的条目。切 jieba 或在查询里 quote <code>&quot;RPC&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>top_k 太大返回慢</strong>：bm25_importance rerank 是 O(k log k)，top_k=1000 比 top_k=10 慢 50x。建议 top_k &lt;= 20。</li>\n<li><strong>以为 FTS5 支持模糊匹配</strong>：FTS5 是词形匹配不是模糊匹配，&quot;kitex&quot; 找不到 &quot;kitexx&quot; 拼错条目。需要 trigram tokenizer 或额外 levenshtein 处理。</li>\n<li><strong>跨语言混合索引</strong>：英文条目用 porter 词干合并、中文条目用 jieba 分词——FTS5 单表只能一个 tokenizer。建议分两表或都用 unicode61 + phrase quote。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>FTS5 是 Hermes 在&quot;个人记忆检索&quot;场景对&quot;零依赖 + 毫秒响应 + 布尔表达力&quot;的工程取舍。它不解决语义相似度（&quot;汽车&quot;找&quot;机动车&quot;），但在结构化标签 + importance 加权配合下，对个人记忆 10^5 量级体感优于裸向量检索。<code>memory_query</code> 工具把 FTS5 能力暴露给 Tier 1 客户端反向调用，是 Hermes 双向 MCP 架构的核心 tool 之一。下一篇看 curator 如何周期重排 importance、维护这个索引、退役过时条目。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SQLite FTS5 全文检索与召回","id":"sqlite-fts5-全文检索与召回"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FTS5 索引结构","id":"fts5-索引结构"},{"level":2,"text":"memory_query API 语法","id":"memory_query-api-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"Tokenizer 选型","id":"tokenizer-选型"},{"level":2,"text":"性能特性","id":"性能特性"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Tier 1 反向调用的接入","id":"与-tier-1-反向调用的接入"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OpenClaw 三件套：AGENTS + SOUL + USER","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/openclaw-three-file-system"},"next":{"title":"Curator 维护周期与自演进","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/curator-maintenance-cycle"}}